.TH DANBY-POYNTINGROBERTSON 1
.SH NAME
danby-poyntingrobertson \- radiation drag on an orbiting dust grain
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/poyntingrobertson
.SH MODEL
Radiation pressure reduces effective solar gravity while tangential radiation
drag removes angular momentum, producing an inward spiral.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/poyntingrobertson.b
